## GraalVM Native Image

Native release builds use GraalVM Community Edition and its Native Image
tooling. GraalVM Community Edition is distributed under its own GPLv2 with
Classpath Exception terms and accompanying notices. The toolchain is a
build-time requirement; it is not linked as an application library by the
JVM build.

## GNU C Library

Linux native binaries use the system glibc dynamically and require glibc
2.35 or newer. glibc is licensed under LGPL-2.1-or-later and includes the
GNU Lesser General Public License text and notices supplied by the operating
system. The native executable does not statically link glibc. This project
does not support musl or another alternate libc for its release binaries.

## Other build tools

Maven and the Maven plugins used by the build are build-time tools. Their
licenses and notices are supplied by their respective distributions and are
not bundled into the runtime.
